ources</h3>\n            <ul>\n                <li>Information provided at events or seminars.</li>\n                <li>Information from surveys.</li>\n                <li>Publicly available information.</li>\n                <li>Information you consent to share with us from third parties.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>\n            <p>We use your personal information to:</p>\n            <ul>\n                <li>Provide the requested Services.</li>\n                <li>Ensure the proper functioning of our Services.</li>\n                <li>Offer and improve our Services.</li>\n                <li>Provide technical support.</li>\n                <li>Facilitate navigation and usability of our Services.</li>\n                <li>Conduct advertising and marketing (with your consent where required).</li>\n                <li>Advertise third-party products/services (with your consent where required).</li>\n                <li>Diagnose technical issues.</li>\n                <li>Maintain security and compliance.</li>\n                <li>Administer our websites.</li>\n                <li>Personalize your experience.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>We also use aggregated and anonymized data for reporting trends and statistics. Payment details are used only to process transactions. Recorded calls may be used for quality control and training.</p>\n            <h3>Sharing of Information</h3>\n            <p>We may share your personal information:</p>\n            <ul>\n                <li>With Partners to help you use our services, provide offers, or deliver relevant products (with your consent where required).</li>\n                <li>With Third-Party Vendors to assist with customer service, fraud prevention, analytics, advertising, hosting, and other operational needs.</li>\n                <li>For Corporate Transactions in the event of mergers, acquisitions, or sales of assets.</li>\n                <li>With Authorized