g.</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>Requests require identity verification and may be refused if legally justified.</p>\n            <h3>Children</h3>\n            <p>Our Services are not intended for those under 18, and we do not knowingly collect data from minors.</p>\n            <h3>Data Transfer</h3>\n            <p>Your data may be processed or stored in the United States or other countries outside your location, with safeguards to ensure compliance with privacy laws.</p>\n            <h3>Notification of Changes</h3>\n            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy and will notify you via our website or email before significant changes take effect. Continued use of our Services after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>\n            <h3>Contact Us</h3>\n            <p>If you have questions or concerns about this policy, contact us at:</p>\n            <p>privacy@cloudhost247.com</p>\n            <p>www.cloudhost247.com</p>\n            <p><strong>Last modified: August 14, 2025</strong></p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"text-align:center;\">Powered by <a href=\"https://www.whmcs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">WHMCompleteSolution</a></p>\n</section>";

